{"id":1948280,"shortDescription":"Stacklands es un juego de construir aldeas apilando cartas para conseguir comida, construir estructuras y luchar contra criaturas. 🃏 Por ejemplo, si colocas una carta de Aldeano sobre una de Arbusto de bayas, se crearán cartas de Baya para comer. 🃏 ¡Juega bien tus cartas y expande tu aldea!","developers":["Sokpop Collective"],"publishers":["Sokpop Collective"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Cromos de Steam","Steam Workshop","Compat. parcial con mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"8 ABR 2022","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769357052","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948280/ss_8a4eae84cdc5e8996a33d66c22f1537568654aaf.600x338.jpg?t=1769357052","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948280/ss_8a4eae84cdc5e8996a33d66c22f1537568654aaf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769357052"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948280/ss_962b1fd0961f54cd3b7c3f7a5181ef9f260ff1af.600x338.jpg?t=1769357052","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948280/ss_962b1fd0961f54cd3b7c3f7a5181ef9f260ff1af.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769357052"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948280/ss_bd3af9ad2dc489246661bb4fe0488a4ccacf7d3f.600x338.jpg?t=1769357052","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948280/ss_bd3af9ad2dc489246661bb4fe0488a4ccacf7d3f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769357052"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948280/ss_4a2a44468bec65a6beb57138cdac779154fc4529.600x338.jpg?t=1769357052","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1948280/ss_4a2a44468bec65a6beb57138cdac779154fc4529.1920x1080.jpg?t=1769357052"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor